    <!-- Description -->
    <summary>Intelligent code generation and project management CLI tool powered by AI</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
# CodeCraft CLI

CodeCraft CLI is an intelligent code generation and project management tool that helps developers create, modify, and optimize code using AI-powered assistance.

## Features

- **Smart Code Generation**: Generate real, production-ready code with comprehensive validation
- **Project Analysis**: Deep understanding of your codebase structure and patterns
- **Multi-file Support**: Generate and manage complex, multi-file implementations
- **Interactive Mode**: Step-by-step guidance with user approval and previews
- **Framework Agnostic**: Works with React, Vue, Angular, Node.js, Python, and more
- **Validation Pipeline**: Comprehensive syntax, type, security, and performance validation

## Commands

- `codecraft generate <description>` - Generate code from natural language descriptions
- `codecraft modify <file> <changes>` - Modify existing files with AI assistance
- `codecraft refactor <path> <goals>` - Intelligent code refactoring
- `codecraft fix <error>` - Automatically fix compilation and runtime errors
- `codecraft optimize <target>` - Performance and code quality optimization

## Getting Started

After installation, run:
```
codecraft --help
```

For detailed documentation, visit: https://codecraft.dev/docs

## Requirements

- Windows 10 or later
- PowerShell 5.1 or later (PowerShell Core 6+ recommended)
- .NET Framework 4.8 or .NET 6+ (automatically installed if missing)

## Notes

This package installs the latest stable version of CodeCraft CLI. The tool will be available globally in your PATH as `codecraft` and `cc` (short alias).
]]></description>
    
